
                     WELCOME TO MODULA-2 1.0
                     -----------------------

HOW TO GET HELP
---------------

If you need help with MODULA-2, please read the reference manual
thoroughly.  If you still have a question and need technical assistance,
please have the following information ready before calling technical
support:

1. Product name and version number.  (The version number of MODULA-2
   is displayed in the logon on screen when you first load M2.COM)
2. Computer name, model, and any additional hardware.
3. Operating system and version number.  (The version number generally
   is displayed when your system is first booted.)

Technical assistance is available from the agent who sold you your copy
of MODULA-2.

